{"id":16483,"date":"2024-06-08T16:26:54","date_gmt":"2024-06-08T10:56:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/?post_type=property&#038;p=16483"},"modified":"2024-06-20T13:43:22","modified_gmt":"2024-06-20T08:13:22","slug":"paras-the-manor","status":"publish","type":"property","link":"https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/property\/paras-the-manor\/","title":{"rendered":"Paras The Manor | 4 BHK Ultra Luxury Gwal Pahari Gurgaon"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2 class=\"\" data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:53\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Paras The Manor: Discover Luxury Living in a Green Oasis<\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:107\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Paras The Manor: Imagine waking up to breathtaking views of the Aravalli Hills, stepping onto a spacious balcony bathed in sunshine, and feeling the tranquillity of nature all around you.<\/strong> The Manor, a stunning architectural masterpiece, offers this and much more, mere minutes away from the bustle of Gurugram.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:42\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>A Unique Blend of Modernity and Nature<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:110\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The Manor seamlessly blends contemporary glass-fronted design with meticulously landscaped grounds, creating a haven of luxury amidst verdant serenity. Imagine expansive living spaces filled with natural light, thanks to the floor-to-ceiling windows and clear glass balconies. These balconies not only blur the lines between indoors and outdoors but also provide stunning views of the surrounding greenery and the Aravalli Hills.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:60\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>S.O.U.L. Philosophy: Designed for Comfort and Livability<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:243\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Every detail at The Manor reflects the S.O.U.L. design philosophy \u2013 Sustainability, Optimization, Uniqueness, and Livability. Clean layouts maximize space, while long, trailing balconies offer both shade and a seamless connection to nature. The grand entrance and lobbies create a lasting first impression, while state-of-the-art amenities elevate your lifestyle to new heights.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:35\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Live in the Lap of Green Luxury<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:371\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Paras The Manor isn&#8217;t just another high-rise development. It&#8217;s a sanctuary where you can immerse yourself in the beauty of nature. Stroll through manicured lawns, relax in airy gazebos, or unwind amidst the tranquillity of intimate alcoves edged with lush greenery. Witness the confluence of nature&#8217;s beauty and expert craftsmanship, creating a haven of peace and indulgence.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:46\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Unparalleled Views and Serene Surroundings<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:375\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The Manor boasts the rare luxury of open green spaces and panoramic views from almost any vantage point. Imagine gardens designed in a soothing palette of greens and whites, accented by boxwood hedges and cool grey stone pathways. Rows of lavender interweave with water features that reflect the clear blue sky, while long avenues of trees and refreshing fountains create a calming ambiance.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:47\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Escape the Ordinary and Embrace Tranquility<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"23:1-23:458\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">At The Manor, your home becomes a refuge from the everyday hustle and bustle. Mornings begin with breathtaking sunrises painting the sky cornflower blue. Expansive balconies offer uninterrupted views of the Aravallis throughout the day, transforming into your own private oasis for enjoying dramatic sunsets and starlit nights. No matter how chaotic your day may be, stepping into your elegant haven at The Manor provides a sense of peace and tranquillity.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:48\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Wake Up to the Majesty of the Aravalli Hills<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"27:1-27:205\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Every day at The Manor promises the grandeur of waking up to the majestic Aravalli Hills. This unparalleled retreat offers a canvas of unparalleled luxury, where every sunrise and sunset is a masterpiece.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:46\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Experience the Epitome of Luxurious Living<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:350\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Step into your spacious residence and be captivated by the expansive interiors designed to showcase the beauty of nature. The floor-to-ceiling windows and glass balconies create a living canvas, framing the breathtaking Aravalli Hills from every corner. The architectural brilliance seamlessly merges the outdoors with the indoors, creating a truly mesmerizing environment.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"33:1-33:47\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Your Exclusive Gateway to a World of Luxury<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:677\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The Manor Club, accessible only to residents, offers an unparalleled experience of &#8220;Exclusive Inclusivity.&#8221; Within these grand walls, you&#8217;ll find a world catering to your every desire. Imagine a grand banquet hall perfect for laughter and lively gatherings, a vibrant children&#8217;s lounge, a serene library for quiet escapes, and a stimulating card room.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:677\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The state-of-the-art gymnasium pulsates with energy, while the rooftop terrace offers an oasis of tranquillity with an all-weather pool reflecting the vastness of the sky. A caf\u00e9 nestled amidst lush greenery beckons for intimate conversations, making The Manor Club a unique journey of luxury crafted for a privileged few.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"37:1-37:29\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Unwind Under the Open Sky<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"39:1-39:249\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Experience the magic of taking a midnight swim beneath a blanket of stars in the heart of the city. The all-weather pool on the second floor of the club is perfect for a refreshing dip or simply soaking in the tranquillity as you reflect on the day.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"41:1-41:44\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>A Spectrum of Amenities Designed for You<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"43:1-43:477\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Paras The Manor offers a comprehensive range of amenities designed to elevate your lifestyle. From spacious parking lots with dedicated bicycle parking and EV charging stations to comfortable seating areas in common areas and braille\/audio assistance in lifts, every detail is meticulously considered for your comfort and convenience. The Manor is also IGBC certified, ensuring reduced operating costs, improved indoor air quality, and a commitment to environmental responsibility.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"45:1-45:46\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>The Manor \u2013 Where Luxury Meets Tranquility<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"47:1-47:171\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Discover a lifestyle beyond compare at The Manor. Contact us today to learn more about this extraordinary opportunity to own a piece of paradise in the heart of Gurugram.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">More such options are available. The image is shared for illustration.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Call now to get mo